### 风险信号写入 — PROPOSED
### 将风险评估节点的结构化结果写入 risk_signals

POST {{API_BASE}}/api/risk_signals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}

{
  "user_hash": "{{USER_HASH}}",
  "source": "私聊",
  "risk_type": "{{#1757936891962.structured_output.intent_type#}}",
  "score": {{RISK_SCORE}},
  "ts": "{{NOW_ISO}}",
  "evidence": {
    "snippets": ["{{#sys.query#}}"],
    "model": "workflow-风险评估-{{MODEL_VERSION}}",
    "summary": "{{#1757936891962.structured_output.summary#}}"
  },
  "window": "d1",
  "level": {{#1757936891962.structured_output.risk_level#}}
}

### 变量说明
# {{API_BASE}}: 网关地址
# {{API_KEY}}: 认证密钥
# {{USER_HASH}}: 脱敏用户哈希
# {{RISK_SCORE}}: 风险得分（0-1，可由模型或规则计算；若无用 0.8 for level>=3 / 0.5 for 1-2 / 0 for 0）
# {{NOW_ISO}}: 当前时间 ISO8601
# {{MODEL_VERSION}}: 模型/工作流版本标识

